  "changes": [
    "Configurable microphone readiness on meeting join to avoid first-unmute device startup; preparation defaults to external power and can be disabled or explicitly enabled on battery.",
    "Brief private camera priming after joining; camera metadata discovery completes before media playback to avoid a measured main-thread device-discovery stall.",
